[(In the patch below, the [clip~] followed by [cos~] and [+~ 1] is the)]
[(enveloping \050"windowing"\051 function, which appears in the top graph.)]
[(The carrier, on the other hand, is a broken sinusoid made by)]
[(amplifying the [phasor~] \050the [*~] controlled by "center freq."\051 and)]
